        <name>shortHashFrequency_</name>
        <qualifiedname>AGRemapCore::HashTools::shortHashFrequency_</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
How many times each short hash value has been produced so far by
``getShortDeterministicHashStr()``, keyed by that short hash value.

Not encountering a key yet implies a frequency of 0 (relies on
``std::unordered_map``&apos;s own default-insertion behaviour for missing keys).
</verbatim> </para>
